      "article_id": "article_06e285fb23b52d6e",
      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "Built on reference architectures for NVIDIA GB200 NVL72-powered AI factories , the blueprint taps into Universal Scene Description (OpenUSD) asset libraries. This allows developers to aggregate detailed 3D and simulation data representing all aspects of the data center into a single, unified model, enabling them to design and simulate advanced AI infrastructure optimized for efficiency, throughput and resiliency.",
      "entity_name_normalized_hint": "Universal Scene Description (OpenUSD",
      "entity_name_raw": "Universal Scene Description (OpenUSD",
