      "archive_timestamp": "20250519052902",
      "article_id": "article_06e285fb23b52d6e",
      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "The OpenUSD-based models within the blueprint are inherently SimReady , designed from the ground up to be physics-based. This is especially valuable for developing and testing physical AI and agentic AI within these AI factories, enabling rapid and large-scale industrial AI simulations of power and cooling systems, building automation and overall IT operations.",
