      "article_id": "article_06e285fb23b52d6e",
      "body_recovery_method": "wayback",
      "context_excerpt": "A key enhancement to this blueprint is the SimReady standardization workflow . Originally developed as a SimReady standardization proposal to streamline NVIDIA’s internal creation of OpenUSD assets, this now publicly available, industry-agnostic resource offers standardized requirements and processes for developing SimReady capabilities. It empowers data center developers and owners to efficiently establish, optimize and rigorously test their own digital twins of critical infrastructure, particularly for electrical and thermal management within AI factories.",
